Z||000010||Dave Gunsul||07-26-2001||03:03 AM||||If you guys want to see a really good car movie see The Gumball Rally!<BR>There's a Cobra,not a mustang a REAL Cobra,<BR>that races across country with a lot of other neat cars. This movie is a lot like Cannon Ball Run but it predates it and it's less of a comedy and more of a hardcore car movie!<P>I have a collection of car movies including:<BR>Gumball Rally<BR>Cannonball 1 and 2<BR>Hotrod (this was a 1979 T.V. movie)<BR>Gone in 60 secs (original and new version)<BR>Dazed and Confused<BR>Heart Like a Wheel<BR>Born to Run<BR>Days of Thunder<BR>American Graffiti<BR>Smokey and the Bandit<BR>The Wraith<BR>Speed Zone<BR>Two Lane Blacktop<BR>California Kid<BR>The Drag Racer<BR>Christine<BR>Death Race 2000<BR>Catch Me if You Can<BR>The Hollywood Knights<BR>Mad Max (all three movies)<BR>Also have the car episode of the Friday the 13th series.<BR>What? I am not obsesed!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||14
